AnyBCQ + Wanda compatibility patch
The patch at patches/anybcq_wanda/anybcq_wanda.patch modifies the following
files from the official AnyBCQ codebase:

- run_clm.py
- data_utils.py
- anybcq/evaluate/eval.py
- anybcq/inference/AnyBCQForCausalLM.py

